,"text":"Are you awake, Maria-2?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_7","text":"Uh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_8","text":"Yes. I'm awake.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_9","text":"You're Doctor Maria, aren't you? Nice to meet you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_10","text":"Strictly speaking, this isn't our first meeting... but for you, I suppose it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_11","text":"At any rate, yes, I'm Maria.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_12","text":"The original version of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_13","text":"I've heard all about... Actually, that's not quite right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_14","text":"I know all about you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_15","text":"I'm sure. Do you like the room?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_16","text":"Yeah, it's nice. It feels like I've lived in it for so long, even though I'm pretty sure it's my first time here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_17","text":"I'm glad you like it, though I suppose it's only natural that you do, seeing how your tastes are my tastes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_18","text":"Are you able to move? If not, we can try this again later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_19","text":"I'm fine. It's no problem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_20","text":"Good. Then come down and let's begin.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_21","text":"Watch the stairs on your way down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_22","text":"Okay, Doctor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_23","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_23","text":"*Beep*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_24","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_25","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_25","text":"Maria-2 looks around the room silently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_26","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_26","text":"It is a small, cramped space packed with trinkets that feel strangely familiar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_27","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_27","text":"It feels extremely comfortable to her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_28","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_28","text":"Maria-2 gets up, opens the door, and steps outside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_29","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_29","text":"She descends the stairs and opens another door.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"SilverGun_LAB","bgArt":"silvergun_lab","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_30","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_30","text":"A wide, bright space reveals itself,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_maria-n_theroom","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_31","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_31","text":"and a familiar face stands before her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["doctormaria"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_32","text":"Hello, Maria-2.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_33","text":"Hello, Doctor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_34","text":"Well then, should we get straight to it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_35","text":"Sure. I'm ready.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_36","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_36","text":"Guided by Doctor Maria, Maria-2 takes her place at the reference room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_37","text":"So you want me to learn all of this material?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_38","text":"That's correct. While your NIMPH has been used to give you basic knowledge,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_39","text":"it is important that you actually learn things for yourself and put them into practice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_40","text":"That way, both your mind and your body will remember, which is the surest way to retain information.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_41","text":"Your memory will be a source of strength that carries you forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_42","text":"Okay, I understand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_43","text":"There's a practice area next door. Feel free to use it whenever you feel the need to apply anything you've learned.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_44","text":"If there's anything you don't know, or you're unsure how to use the equipment, let me know, okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_45","text":"Thank you, Doctor Maria.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_46","text":"Work hard. I'm expecting great things from you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_47","text":"I will.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_48","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_48","text":"Maria-2 begins to pore over the material.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_49","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_49","text":"Doctor Maria steps back, sits down on the couch, and watches her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_50","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_50","text":"After a long while, Maria-2 rises from her seat and moves to the practice area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_51","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_51","text":"She picks up a gun and practices firing it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_52","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_52","text":"She then swiftly moves from cover to cover.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_53","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_53","text":"After a long stretch of training, Maria-2 returns to the reference room and sits back down, seemingly dissatisfied with something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_54","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_54","text":"Doctor Maria continues watching her intently until eventually falling asleep.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_55","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_55","text":"A while later, Doctor Maria is awoken by the sense of someone near.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["maria-2"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_56","text":"Oh... Sorry. I didn't mean to wake you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_57","text":"... Were you putting a blanket over me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_58","text":"Yes. You are human, after all, and I didn't want your body temperature to drop.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_59","text":"You're very kind, Maria-2.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"maria-2","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_60","text":"I inherited it from you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_61","text":"... Right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_62","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_62","text":"Time passes, and Maria-2 completes all of her training.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian1_prologue_63","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian1_prologue_63","text":"She descends the stairs and heads for the lowest floor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Armory","bgArt":"armory","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"e